# How to Play Locke in League of Legends — Build, Runes & Combos (Patch 26.23)

**The Ashen Exorcist**

A mobile magic damage assassin who marks enemies, combines abilities with basic attacks, and grows stronger by executing enemy champions.

Locke is a mid-lane assassin specializing in magic damage, mobility, and finishing weakened targets. His effectiveness depends on combining Ritual Nails with basic attacks, taking advantage of Soul Ignition's attack speed, and securing executions with Purgatory.

Unlike many AP assassins, Locke needs to remain within attacking distance during certain stages of his combos to maximize his damage.

This guide covers Locke's Patch 26.23 build, level-by-level skill order, runes, combos, laning strategy, teamfights, and matchups.

